# Onboard parameters for Holybro H-Flow (DroneCAN optical flow + rangefinder)
#
# Target: PX4 v1.17.0 (ubicoders fork), FMUv5 (px4_fmu-v5_default) or FMUv6X.
# Params-only: enables the DroneCAN driver, subscribes to the flow and range
# messages, and makes EKF2 fuse them for indoor (no-GNSS) velocity/position.
# NO firmware source changes.
#
# Apply with QGroundControl: Vehicle Setup -> Parameters -> Tools ->
#   "Load from file" -> select this file -> write -> REBOOT the vehicle.
# (Or paste the nsh block from README.md into Analyze Tools -> MAVLink Console.)
#
# Type codes (QGC .params format): INT32 = 6, FLOAT = 9.
# QGC ignores lines beginning with '#'; only the tab-separated rows are imported.
#
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
#
# --- DroneCAN driver + subscriptions (all reboot_required) ---
# UAVCAN_ENABLE: 0=off 1=sensors manual 2=sensors auto node-ID 3=sensors+ESCs.
1	1	UAVCAN_ENABLE	2	6
# Subscribe to com.hex.equipment.flow.Measurement (default 0 = off).
1	1	UAVCAN_SUB_FLOW	1	6
# Subscribe to uavcan.equipment.range_sensor.Measurement (default 0 = off).
1	1	UAVCAN_SUB_RNG	1	6
# Range limits stamped on distance_sensor (defaults 0 / 999 m). AFBR-S50LV85D ~30 m.
1	1	UAVCAN_RNG_MIN	0.08	9
1	1	UAVCAN_RNG_MAX	30	9
#
# --- EKF2: fuse flow + range, no GNSS ---
# EKF2_OF_CTRL: 1 = optical flow aiding on (default already 1; set explicitly).
1	1	EKF2_OF_CTRL	1	6
# EKF2_RNG_CTRL: 0=off 1=conditional (low speed/altitude) 2=always. Default 1.
1	1	EKF2_RNG_CTRL	1	6
# EKF2_HGT_REF: 0=Baro 1=GPS 2=Range 3=Vision. Range for a flow-only indoor test.
# NOTE: overrides ips_phase1.params (which sets 3 = Vision). reboot_required.
1	1	EKF2_HGT_REF	2	6
# EKF2_GPS_CTRL bitmask (default 7). 0 = no GNSS aiding indoors.
1	1	EKF2_GPS_CTRL	0	6
# EKF2_RNG_A_HMAX: max height for conditional range aid (default 5 m).
1	1	EKF2_RNG_A_HMAX	10	9
# EKF2_RNG_QLTY_T: seconds of valid range before it is trusted (default 1.0).
1	1	EKF2_RNG_QLTY_T	0.2	9
#
# --- Sensor-level flow limits (sensors module) ---
# SENS_FLOW_ROT: 0 = sensor X axis along vehicle X. 2 = yaw 90, 4 = yaw 180, 6 = yaw 270.
# Check with the movement table in docs/en/sensor/optical_flow.md (forward = +Y).
1	1	SENS_FLOW_ROT	0	6
# SENS_FLOW_MINHGT / MAXHGT: height window in which flow is fused (defaults 0.08 / 100 m).
1	1	SENS_FLOW_MINHGT	0.08	9
1	1	SENS_FLOW_MAXHGT	25	9
# SENS_FLOW_MAXR: max reliable angular flow rate, rad/s (default 8). 7.4 per ARK Flow docs.
1	1	SENS_FLOW_MAXR	7.4	9
#
# Optional, flight only: if flow is the sole horizontal source and position mode
# oscillates, lower MPC_XY_P (default 0.95) to ~0.5. Not set here.
